		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Fate-weaving fey giant women. They measure and snip mortal lives in the warp and weft of myriad worlds.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (chain), <strong>HP</strong> 51, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 +3 scissor +6 (1d8+3) or snip fate or shift fate, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +6, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Shift Fate</strong>. May remove or bestow a luck token on one creature within double near.</p><p></p><p><strong>Snip Fate</strong>. Shear the thread of life of one creature within double near. Target takes 4d6 damage, dying at 0 HP. Scissors become nonmagical if slain.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
